Stigvidd — copyright holders and contributors
=============================================

Source files in this repository carry the collective notice

    Copyright (C) 2025-2026 The Stigvidd Authors

"The Stigvidd Authors" is a convenience label, not a legal entity and not an
assignment of anything. There is no CLA and no copyright pooling: each person
below individually holds copyright in their own contributions. That matters in
one concrete way — **relicensing any part of this project requires the
agreement of every holder listed here**, not of a majority or of a maintainer.

Copyright holders, in order of first contribution:

    Therese Lindberg   <therese.m.lindberg@gmail.com>
    Martin Börjesson   <martinjborjesson@gmail.com>
    Ralf Lindberg      <ralf.lindberg@gmail.com>

The authoritative record of who wrote what is the git history:

    git shortlog -sne --all

Licensing is described in README.md; the app is under different terms from the
backend and admin web, and app/LICENSE.md explains why.
